{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap into the drifting fun brought by <i>Drift Trolley</i>. Master the driving of drift trolleys to enjoy the thrill of speed and passion. Switch between various trolley styles as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has high operation difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports multiplayer online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go all out in races and find joy in collisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize multiple car models to show your style in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes 15 natural feature maps such as Gobi, jungle, snowfield, and mountains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to reach the finish line without crossing the boundary or colliding.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Lone Ranger of the Gobi","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918620/52c7c0acfdb5ad38e66e304bfc5991190ea5ca5a.jpg"},{"name":"The Eternal Messenger of the Gobi","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918620/9507ef4a38db2e9ef2681328cde43e2690fc0e94.jpg"},{"name":"Jungle Cheetah","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918620/e5a4fe4c2063d128d0c1b9870ccd059d9efd4368.jpg"},{"name":"Son of Light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918620/77cc33825a9c870f2e3c8645d5ccc4f732e8d3a2.jpg"},{"name":"Night Fury","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918620/6a488b0f98f710932f87016323783c6e56ce45db.jpg"},{"name":"Son of the Wind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918620/f7a8d7a9a9b8a95e94657a194a42bec467303a20.jpg"},{"name":"Burning Wings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918620/8f90e6e3f